{"id": "EUVD-2026-94353", "enisaUuid": "fdabde3a-2643-300f-987a-f452e99bde03", "description": "In NTFS-3G before 2026.7.7, a out-of-bounds read exists in ntfs_fix_file_name() in libntfs-3g/reparse.c that allows an attacker to read possibly confidential information in ntfs-3g process memory by crafting a malicious NTFS image. The out-of-bounds read is triggered by a readlink on a corrupted file.", "datePublished": "2026-10-07T00:00:00", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-07T14:29:19", "baseScore": 5.5, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:N/A:N", "references": ["https://github.com/tuxera/ntfs-3g/releases#release-2026.7.7", "https://github.com/tuxera/ntfs-3g/security/advisories/GHSA-52gr-j4pv-9pjh"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-46571"], "assigner": "mitre", "epss": 0.13, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "4fc6ec51-e960-338a-b01c-f01a925aabe2", "product": {"name": "n/a", "vendor": {"name": "n/a"}}, "product_version": "n/a"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "60994e59-92d2-30fd-ac9b-90ebe7b94554", "vendor": {"name": "n/a"}}], "isExploited": false}